(
    title: "Centipede",
    description: Some("You steer the Bug Blaster along the bottom of a mushroom field, shooting apart a centipede that snakes down the screen and splits wherever it is hit. Fleas rain fresh mushrooms, scorpions poison them, and the spider weaves close for big points — with an extra life every 12,000. The port thins the arcade\'s mushroom field and trades the trackball for the standard controller."),
